  "title": "Unique Resinous Portuguese Korean Pear Stew",
  "description": "A rich and velvety stew featuring Korean pear, this dish is a unique blend of Portuguese and Korean flavors, designed to cure and provide anti-inflammatory relief, traditionally cooked in a comal.",
